---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
	<div class="divider">☆ ☆ ☆ ☆ ☆</div>

	<h1 style="text-align:center;">$ whoami</h1>

	<div class="surface">
		<p>
			I am a <strong>23-year-old</strong> developer based in <strong>Venezuela</strong>.
			Standing at <strong>2 meters tall</strong>, I spend most of my time looking down at the physical
			world and staring directly into the digital one.
		</p>
		<p style="margin-top:0.75rem;">
			I don't just use Linux; I <em>grew up in it</em>. I have been running
			<strong>Arch Linux since I was 10 years old</strong>. I prefer minimalism, control, and systems
			that do exactly what I tell them to do — nothing more, nothing less.
		</p>
	</div>

	<div class="divider">☆ ☆ ☆ ☆ ☆</div>

	<h2 style="text-align:center;">cat /etc/interests</h2>

	<div class="surface">
		<p>
			My downtime is dedicated to high-skill gameplay and narrative consumption.
		</p>
		<ul style="list-style-type:'▸ ';padding-left:2rem;margin-top:0.75rem;">
			<li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
				<span style="color:var(--reimu-red);">The Bullet Hell:</span>
				Deeply invested in the <strong>Touhou Project</strong> universe.
				Shrine Maiden, youkai extermination, and dodging impossible patterns.
			</li>
			<li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
				<span style="color:var(--reimu-red);">The Grind:</span>
				<strong>Phantasy Star Online</strong> veteran. Pioneer II is my second home.
			</li>
			<li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
				<span style="color:var(--reimu-red);">The Narrative:</span>
				I consume Manga and Anime with a critical eye.
				<br />
				<em>Favorites:</em> <strong>Konosuba</strong> (Megumin is the path),
				<strong>Serial Experiments Lain</strong> (the bible), and <strong>Berserk</strong>.
				<br />
				<em>Current Status:</em> Catching up on the One Piece monolith.
			</li>
		</ul>
	</div>

	<div class="divider">☆ ☆ ☆ ☆ ☆</div>

	<h2 style="text-align:center;">neofetch --hakka</h2>

	<div class="terminal">
		<span style="color:var(--cyan);">OS:</span> Arch Linux x86_64<br />
		<span style="color:var(--cyan);">Uptime:</span> 13 years (Since age 10)<br />
		<span style="color:var(--cyan);">Kernel:</span> linux-zen<br />
		<span style="color:var(--cyan);">Shell:</span> zsh<br />
		<span style="color:var(--cyan);">DE/WM:</span> Tiling Window Manager (Custom)<br />
		<span style="color:var(--cyan);">Terminal:</span> Alacritty<br />
		<span style="color:var(--cyan);">Editor:</span> VS Code (for now)<br />
		<span style="color:var(--cyan);">Languages:</span> Python · Java · JavaScript · TypeScript<br />
		<span style="color:var(--cyan);">Vibe:</span> Laincore / Serial Experiments / Touhou<br />
		<span style="color:var(--cyan);">Location:</span> Venezuela<br />
		<span style="color:var(--cyan);">Height:</span> 200cm<br />
		<span style="color:var(--cyan);">Domain:</span> hakkurei.com<br />
		<span style="color:var(--cyan);">Favorite Colors:</span>
		<span style="color:var(--reimu-red);">#e60000</span>
		<span style="color:var(--gold);">#ffcc00</span>
		<span style="color:var(--magenta);">#ff00ff</span>
	</div>
</Layout>